---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Lead Strategy" description="How Lead Strategy Canada Inc collects, uses and protects the personal information you share through leadstrategy.ca.">
	<PageIntro kicker="Legal" title="Privacy" lead="How Lead Strategy Canada Inc handles the personal information you share with us through this site. Effective 26 September 2026." />
	<section class="wrap sec"><div class="legal-copy">
		<h2>Who we are</h2>
		<p>This site is operated by Lead Strategy Canada Inc, a company registered in Canada. Lead Strategy Canada Inc is responsible for the personal information described in this notice. In this notice, “we” and “us” mean Lead Strategy Canada Inc.</p>
		<p>This notice covers leadstrategy.ca and enquiries sent to us. It does not cover FincWin, the personal money-management app we publish. FincWin has its own privacy policy at <a href="https://www.fincwin.com/privacy">fincwin.com/privacy</a>.</p>

		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p><strong>Enquiries.</strong> When you use the contact form or email us, we collect your name, email address, organisation, the service you are asking about and whatever you include in your message.</p>
		<p><strong>Technical information.</strong> When you visit the site, our hosting provider receives standard request information, such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested. This is used to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.</p>
		<p>This site sets no advertising cookies and runs no analytics or tracking scripts.</p>

		<h2>How we use it</h2>
		<p>We use enquiry information to reply to you, scope and deliver work you ask for, keep business records and prevent abuse of the contact form. We do not sell personal information, and we do not add you to marketing email without your separate consent.</p>

		<h2>Service providers</h2>
		<p><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this site, delivers the contact form and, where the form is active, runs Turnstile to check that a submission comes from a person rather than an automated script. <strong>Google Fonts</strong> supplies the site’s typefaces, so Google receives a standard request log when your browser loads them. Enquiries are delivered to our business inbox and the tools we use to manage client work.</p>
		<p>Some of these providers process information outside Canada, including in the United States, where it is subject to local law.</p>

		<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
		<p>We keep enquiry information for as long as we need it to respond and work with you, and afterwards for as long as Canadian law requires us to keep business records. When it is no longer needed, we delete it.</p>

		<h2>Your rights</h2>
		<p>You can ask what personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, withdraw your consent or ask us to delete it, subject to any records the law requires us to keep. Email <a href="mailto:hello@leadstrategy.ca">hello@leadstrategy.ca</a> and we will reply within 30 days.</p>
		<p>If you are not satisfied with our reply, you can contact the <a href="https://www.priv.gc.ca">Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada</a>.</p>

		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>When our practices change, we update this notice and the effective date above.</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>Lead Strategy Canada Inc — <a href="mailto:hello@leadstrategy.ca">hello@leadstrategy.ca</a></p>
	</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
